That was never part of our deal.

261
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:26,380
I can't allow it.

262
00:18:29,260 --> 00:18:30,200
Hey, kid.

263
00:18:30,700 --> 00:18:33,240
Are you misunderstanding something here?

264
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:38,351
I won the goods on this ship, so why
the hell would I have to answer to you?

265
00:18:38,980 --> 00:18:41,440
Before I collect what's already mine!

266
00:18:44,620 --> 00:18:46,444
Kid, you ain't being beautiful.

267
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:50,737
If you're gonna use your knowledge of
the ship for a trade with the bad guys,

268
00:18:50,820 --> 00:18:52,457
at least prepare for the worst,

269
00:18:52,540 --> 00:18:53,370
stupid.

270
00:18:56,420 --> 00:18:58,714
Please, you gotta leave the ship alone!

271
