This isn't fun anymore.

280
00:19:31,740 --> 00:19:32,960
Splatter time.

281
00:19:43,680 --> 00:19:45,740
You okay, Squirt? Over here.

282
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:55,580
Don't move now, or you'll get hurt.

283
