Yeah!

290
00:20:32,520 --> 00:20:34,997
Hey, couldn't you think of
a better way to rescue me?

291
00:20:35,080 --> 00:20:36,600
This sucks, big time!

292
00:20:36,820 --> 00:20:38,467
Don't be so ungrateful, kid!

293
00:20:38,680 --> 00:20:42,268
Besides, I received a heck of
a lot more damage than you did!

294
00:20:57,500 --> 00:21:00,717
If we climb a little higher, we
can get to a ventilation shaft.

295
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,094
Okay, let's get going.

296
00:21:02,380 --> 00:21:04,792
I mean, like, let's get going right away.

297
00:21:05,380 --> 00:21:06,880
Oh, it's a warehouse.

298
