Sorry about hitting you like
I did, Captain. Forgive me.

301
00:21:23,560 --> 00:21:27,854
It looks like I can't quite control
the ship without your help after all.

302
00:21:28,240 --> 00:21:30,657
So this time, to make it
easier for you to steer,

303
