the passengers for inspiration.

304
00:21:34,840 --> 00:21:35,670
No!

305
00:21:36,500 --> 00:21:38,180
Shit! You are sick!

306
00:21:38,620 --> 00:21:40,160
Just go to hell and die!

307
00:21:41,080 --> 00:21:44,080
