of being told to do that.

308
00:21:45,380 --> 00:21:46,760
Let me go!

309
00:21:47,300 --> 00:21:49,377
You're looking in the wrong direction.

310
00:21:49,460 --> 00:21:51,695
The control lever is right over there.

311
00:21:51,840 --> 00:21:52,820
It's your ship.

312
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:54,897
You should be the one
to break the bad news.

313
00:21:54,980 --> 00:21:58,392
At least you'll be going down
with it like a good captain.

314
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:07,400
You only have one thing to do.

315
00:22:08,240 --> 00:22:09,320
Speed it up.

316
00:24:07,140 --> 00:24:10,837
people who sin say this
that they had to to

317
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:14,597
survive people who sin
say this it's too late

318
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:17,897
now to stop a shadow called sin dogs them

319
00:24:17,980 --> 00:24:21,040
steadily from behind
silently without a word

320
00:24:21,760 --> 00:24:24,497
remorse and agony are
repeated only to end up at

321
00:24:24,580 --> 00:24:27,637
despair in the end but the
sinners just don't know

322
00:24:27,720 --> 00:24:30,517
that if they'd only turn
around there's a light there

323
00:24:30,600 --> 00:24:33,600
a light which keeps shining
on them ever so lonely,

324
00:24:33,720 --> 00:24:35,580
